@startuml
' Phase 5 — Forge: as-built. Copy of plan.uml edited to what was actually built.

title Phase 5 — Forge (as built)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "aa-forge (Go; imports contracts)" as forge {
  component "forge (types + capability interfaces + audit log)" as core
  component "fake (deterministic, in-memory, offline)" as fake
  component "template (renders docs/github-os/templates)" as template
  component "memsync (forge -> contracts, Sink)" as memsync
  component "lifecycle (phase orchestrator + human gate)" as lifecycle
  component "rpc (createIssue/openPullRequest/checkpoint/release)" as rpc
}

package "aa-contracts" as contracts
package "docs/github-os/templates" as templates
package "aa-memory (Sink writer deferred)" as memory

contracts --> memsync
templates --> template
core --> fake
fake --> lifecycle
template --> lifecycle
memsync --> lifecycle
fake --> rpc
lifecycle --> rpc
memory ..> memsync : Sink (deferred)

note right of fake
  As built: deterministic IDs and
  timestamps, an ordered audit log,
  and injectable failures for retry
  and idempotency tests.
end note

note bottom of lifecycle
  As built: ph{N}-{scope} enforced,
  Draft phase PR from start, and
  CompletePhase fails closed without
  an approving actor.
end note

note bottom of rpc
  As built: forge.createIssue,
  forge.openPullRequest, forge.checkpoint,
  forge.release. Merge is not exposed.
  Transport hosting deferred.
end note

@enduml
